-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","review_id":"qvTiSkNh7n4yuQRRDXCRCA","date":"2021-11-29T04:05:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9507139921188354,"text_excerpt":"On my first trip ever to New Orleans and I wasn't leaving until I'd had beignets for breakfast. Having been warned that Cafe Du Monde would be swamped with tourists, I was happy to just find any local old spot that would make me some beignets. My friend Googled this one and when we got there, there was a line that ALMOST made me leave. Glad we decided to wait it out though! It moved fairly quickly and once we made it to the front, we each got our own 3 beignets for $3.99 order, as well as a Southern Breakfast to split (easily got a table as well). She was not a fan of the grits, but also never had them before. I found them to be a delicious consistency, and the accompanying french bread q..."},{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","review_id":"vemwwxm_h9oYiSFXAoZ3MA","date":"2021-08-18T18:34:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316985607147217,"text_excerpt":"Beignets are a big deal in New Orleans and during our recent visit we wanted to try a couple of different places. Between Cafe du Monde and Cafe Beignet, Cafe Beignet held the slight advantage. There are a couple of locations, but the Canal St location was close to our hotel and made for a convenient breakfast. The beignets came out quickly and were good. I also got a Cafe au Lait which was tasty as well."},{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","review_id":"af-sLyuqso5T8tWht34w4Q","date":"2022-01-05T16:37:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9273346662521362,"text_excerpt":"Good location! Two rooms with plenty of seating. Food comes out hot and quick. The beignets here are always good and way better than waiting in line at Cafe Du Monde for. Their coffee is delicious and they offer all their coffee drinks on ice, as well. Service is friendly. Prices are just right. You'll fit right in spilling powdered sugar all over yourself."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","photo_id":"QWKlVEoWRFGLB4g0E4d_1g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QWKlVEoWRFGLB4g0E4d_1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8468567132949829},{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","photo_id":"7uYuqFyrzEhYgAlRgqaOPw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7uYuqFyrzEhYgAlRgqaOPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8354629278182983},{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","photo_id":"aFodosYXo4leDNbDvNWVsg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/aFodosYXo4leDNbDvNWVsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8332647085189819},{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","photo_id":"lxlgksZULkKKLfFzjJFhbg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lxlgksZULkKKLfFzjJFhbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8235785961151123},{"business_id":"085mjp-y4qmKRMIj72x8xw","photo_id":"E_2c0Ey1jqPKYuHOHPcG_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/E_2c0Ey1jqPKYuHOHPcG_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8198044300079346}]},"notebook_case":null}
